WEBVTT

00:00.571 --> 00:01.605
Nimepata mrejesho

00:01.605 --> 00:03.769
kuwa picha ya Chuck Noris katika video iliyopita

00:03.769 --> 00:05.703
inaweza kuwa ilileta balaa kidogo.

00:05.703 --> 00:07.105
Hivyo, kwa video hii, nimeweka

00:07.105 --> 00:09.769
kitu kizuri kidogo.

00:09.769 --> 00:11.770
Hebu tujaribu kurahisisha baadhi ya milinganyo.

00:11.770 --> 00:13.370
Na tutatumia dhana

00:13.370 --> 00:15.272
ambayo tunaijua.

00:15.272 --> 00:20.998
Hivyo, tuseme tunataka kurahisisha mlinganyo 2(3x + 5).

00:21.059 --> 00:23.703
Hii inamaanisha ''3x + 5'' mbili.

00:23.703 --> 00:25.855
Hivyo, hiki ni sawa na ...

00:25.855 --> 00:28.032
Hii ni ''3x + 5'' moja,

00:28.032 --> 00:30.639
na kisha, nitaongeza ''3x + 5'' nyingine.

00:30.639 --> 00:33.904
Hiyo ndiyo maana ya 2(3x + 5).

00:33.904 --> 00:36.104
Hii ni kitu sawa na...

00:36.104 --> 00:37.688
kama tukitazama hapa,

00:37.688 --> 00:40.005
sasa tuna ''3x'' mbili.

00:40.005 --> 00:49.014
Hivyo, tunaweza kuandika kama 2(3x), jumlisha ''5'' mbili.

00:49.087 --> 00:52.171
Hivyo, jumlisha 2(5).

00:52.171 --> 00:53.188
Lakini, unaweza kusema:

00:53.188 --> 00:55.704
je hii si njia ya kutenga vitu

00:55.704 --> 00:57.037
katika hisabati?

00:57.037 --> 01:05.324
Kimsingi nimetenga ''2(3x)'' jumlisha ''2(5)''.

01:05.324 --> 01:08.434
Na nitakuambia: "Ndivyo ilivyo"

01:08.434 --> 01:09.854
Na sababu kwanini nimefanya hivi,

01:09.854 --> 01:10.780
ni kukuonesha kuwa hivyo ndivyo

01:10.796 --> 01:12.769
unavyojua.

01:12.769 --> 01:14.355
Lakini kwa hii tunayoifanya,

01:14.355 --> 01:15.704
hebu tuendelee.

01:15.704 --> 01:21.270
Hivyo, unapozidisha 2(3x), unapata 6x.

01:21.270 --> 01:24.703
Kama ukizidisha 2(5), unapata 10.

01:24.703 --> 01:28.482
Kwa hiyo, hii inarahisishwa kama 6x + 10.

01:28.482 --> 01:30.317
Sasa, hebu tujaribu yenye changamoto zaidi.

01:30.396 --> 01:34.230
Kwa mara nyingine, ni kitu unachokijua .

01:34.230 --> 01:54.591
Hivyo, hebu tuseme nina 7(3y - 5) - 2(10 + 4y).

01:54.591 --> 01:56.503
Sasa hebu tuone kama tunaweza kurahisisha hii.

01:56.503 --> 01:59.638
Tuanze na upande wa kushoto wa mlinganyo.

01:59.638 --> 02:01.571
7(3y - 5).

02:01.571 --> 02:03.438
Tunatakiwa kuisambaza "7".

02:03.438 --> 02:06.038
Hivyo, hii itakuwa 7 mara 3y,

02:06.038 --> 02:08.188
ambayo itakuwa 21y,

02:08.188 --> 02:11.761
Au, kama nina "y" tatu mara saba, hii itakuwa 21y

02:11.771 --> 02:13.190
(unaweza kutumia njia yeyote).

02:13.190 --> 02:15.187
Na kisha nina "7" mara...

02:15.187 --> 02:16.271
Tutakuwa makini na alama zilizotumika.

02:16.271 --> 02:18.370
Hii ni "7" mara hasi 5.

02:18.370 --> 02:22.521
"7" mara "-5" ni "-35".

02:22.521 --> 02:24.038
Hivyo, tumerahisisha hii sehemu ya kushoto.

02:24.038 --> 02:25.271
Hebu turahisishe upande wa kulia.

02:25.271 --> 02:27.605
Kwa hiyo, unaweza kusema:

02:27.605 --> 02:29.701
"Oh, "2" mara "10" na "2" mara "4y",

02:29.701 --> 02:31.472
na kisha utoe,

02:31.472 --> 02:33.996
na kama ukifanya hivyo na kusambaza uliyotoa,

02:33.996 --> 02:35.035
inaweza kufanya kazi.

02:35.035 --> 02:39.478
Lakini, ninapenda kutafakari hii kama "-2".

02:39.478 --> 02:42.103
Na tunakwenda kusambaza "-2" mara "10",

02:42.103 --> 02:46.938
na kisha tunakwenda kusambaza "-2" mara "4y".

02:46.938 --> 02:53.303
Hivyo, "-2" mara "10" ni "-20".

02:53.303 --> 02:56.303
(toa ishirini hapa).

02:56.303 --> 02:58.945
Na kisha "-2" mara "4y"

02:58.945 --> 03:00.493
"-2" mara "4" ni "-8",

03:00.493 --> 03:03.299
hivyo itakuwa "-8y".

03:03.299 --> 03:06.438
Kwa hiyo, tuandike "-8y"

03:06.438 --> 03:08.521
Na sasa tumemaliza kurahisisha.

03:08.521 --> 03:10.770
Hapana, kuna kitu kidogo tunaweza kufanya.

03:10.770 --> 03:13.570
Hatuweza kujumlisha "21y" kwa "-35" au kwa "-20",

03:13.570 --> 03:16.355
kwa sababu hivi ni vitu tofauti

03:16.355 --> 03:17.605
au hatuwezi kutoa vitu tofauti.

03:17.605 --> 03:20.606
Lakini tuna vitu viwili ambavyo tunazidisha "y".

03:20.606 --> 03:22.303
Tuna...

03:22.303 --> 03:24.571
Ngoja nizifanye katika rangi ya kijani.

03:24.571 --> 03:26.105
Tuna 21y, hapa.

03:26.105 --> 03:33.170
Na kisha, kutoka kwenye hiyo tunatoa 8y.

03:33.170 --> 03:34.903
Kwa hiyo 21 ya kitu fulani..

03:34.903 --> 03:37.520
Kama nina 21 ya kitu fulani na nikatoa 8 ya hivyo vitu,

03:37.520 --> 03:39.188
nitabakiwa na 13 ya hivyo vitu.

03:39.188 --> 03:42.438
Kwa hiyo, hizo zitarahisishwa mpaka 13y.

03:42.438 --> 03:51.715
Na kisha, nina "-35" toa "20".

03:51.715 --> 03:56.216
Na kisha, hiyo itarahisishwa mpaka "-55".

03:56.216 --> 03:57.837
Hivyo, hii yote imerahisishwa,

03:57.837 --> 03:59.769
kwa kutumia mgawanyo wa vitu

03:59.769 --> 04:01.938
na kuchanganya vitu vinavyofanana,

04:01.938 --> 04:06.400
tumepata "13y - 55".
